```csharp
public class ExampleModel
{
    public int Age { get;  private set; }
    public string Name { get; }

    public ExampleProperty(string name)
    {
        Name = name;
        Age = 21;
    }
}
```

In this example, there is no way to set the `Age` property, so a model factory is needed.
